                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 6775/625.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Dodge to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">San
                                Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-01-13"><hi rendition="#italic">January 13,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>First business meeting Central American Conference held 11th. Nicaraguan unable
                    at present attend. Costa Rican secured a rule authorizing deliberative sessions
                    of four members requiring five only for a vote. Discussions planned to last two
                    weeks.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dodge.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
